{
  "key": "letter-344-part-01",
  "number": 344,
  "generationId": "01a1e914-b8c0-711e-9c16-018ea4f8d4b1",
  "voice": "Views",
  "speed": 0.9,
  "clips": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "text": "Love.",
      "path": "audio/1971-344/01.mp3",
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 0.720204
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "text": "Meditation is the master key.",
      "path": "audio/1971-344/02.mp3",
      "start": 2.093628,
      "end": 4.048912
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "text": "It can open the doors of the infinite and it can unlock the mystery of the unknown.",
      "path": "audio/1971-344/03.mp3",
      "start": 5.3976869999999995,
      "end": 9.393740999999999
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "text": "But just by possessing the key nothing is attained, unless one uses it.",
      "path": "audio/1971-344/04.mp3",
      "start": 10.658662000000001,
      "end": 14.884965999999999
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "text": "Idries Shah tells a dervish tale: There was once a wise and very rich man who had a son.",
      "path": "audio/1971-344/05.mp3",
      "start": 16.233741,
      "end": 21.784853000000002
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "text": "He said to him: My son, here is a jewelled ring.",
      "path": "audio/1971-344/06.mp3",
      "start": 23.166372,
      "end": 27.678934
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "text": "Keep it is a sign that you are my successor, and pass it down on for posterity.",
      "path": "audio/1971-344/07.mp3",
      "start": 29.083288,
      "end": 34.389388
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "text": "It is of value, of fine appearance, and it has the added capacity of opening a certain door to wealth.",
      "path": "audio/1971-344/08.mp3",
      "start": 35.828549,
      "end": 42.239342
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "text": "Some years later he had another son.",
      "path": "audio/1971-344/09.mp3",
      "start": 43.794263,
      "end": 46.472789
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "text": "When the son was old enough the wise man gave him another ring with the same advice.",
      "path": "audio/1971-344/10.mp3",
      "start": 48.059478000000006,
      "end": 53.32
    }
  ]
}
